e41eff95-229a-46b9-8885-01176f77201b	𝗔𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 ‼️📣	𝗔𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 ‼️📣\n\nCentro Supersales Inc. is currently seeking talented and driven individuals to join their growing team! They have exciting opportunities available for:\n\n• Corporate Engineer\n• Office Staff\n• Human Resource Associate\n• Marketing Associate\n\nFor interested applicants, you may send your application letter and updated resume to their official email: cailum.hrmo@gmail.com\n\nPhotos from CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/480279454_122205796682194106_4601545346569854829_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=dd6889&_nc_ohc=fk75WRZulEUQ7kNvwGXnQSt&_nc_oc=Adq7PjLJ8iyTPH_zPkM5P_Y8W_9xIWCIMBTnL1j-WsWSQ8ZQS7h2O0pSdYk0sGnUdjQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEIwN12bmCgz5Zkf8W43A9mAgKKngZp_4_qU_5DN-nTqg93FUkU0Ct5qDoVQm6CfOOSzJR-Cv0GgA&oh=00_Af6AyK9y6VaEv2p2Qg2x-al_pZ7LF3C44JHps1ouC2hglw&oe=6A01A6EE	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122198862860194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2025-01-16 01:00:49+08	\N	0	\N	2025-01-16 01:00:49+08	2025-01-16 08:25:41+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122198862860194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122198862860194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:05+08
6f442d84-b1fe-49a3-93f1-db8d2bdfd932	It’s time to come home, 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗮𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶!	It’s time to come home, 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗮𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶!\n\nFor 115 years, Central Mindanao University has been a cradle of excellence, nurturing minds and shaping futures.\n\nThis September 14-21, we're not just celebrating CMU's rich history, we're also securing its future. The university is launching a crucial Fencing Project to protect our beloved CMU lands. Your presence at the homecoming isn't just a reunion—it's a statement, an act of unity that will help safeguard our alma mater for generations to come.\n\nBut that's not all! To show our gratitude for your support, we've lined up some incredible door prizes, including a grand prize of a ₱2.5M House and Lot, donated by COE Batch 1999, as well as many other exciting prizes sponsored by various CMU alumni.\n\n🎫 Register now and be counted!\n🔗 https://tinyurl.com/cmu115reg\n✨ Open to all CMU Alumni\n‼️ Registrations ends on September 15, 2025\n✅ Tickets are now available at CMUAAI Office, located at Fulbright Garden\n\nSo, reconnect with your batchmates, relive your best memories, and let's stand together to protect our legacy. Mark your calendars and come home to where it all began.\n\n#BalikCMU #CMU115 #CMULegacy #PadayonCMU #CMUAlumni	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t15.5256-10/542680205_758132713863674_2013137369901887672_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=5fad0e&_nc_ohc=edxo0emd_AsQ7kNvwElsX7l&_nc_oc=AdpLQF5gCqGzLahs_38Em5DMfn-Ktee9SqJEu1YkaxcNXKVB3r03c1E_HIV8SOnx6xY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQGuB9FMibpAHOiZTTGAokS0NA8kmhYhlBbSb7yNt4OnrTusEnIR8ran1tuUHm4C8cB_sUCbFOuTiQ&oh=00_Af6rix8TGN5_5xrSzzWLAuOs8OBZoz_s8kpfRCfweutf2w&oe=6A01A597	https://www.facebook.com/122280450398194106/videos/1314476440271517	\N	\N	t	2025-09-05 03:11:32+08	\N	0	\N	2025-09-05 03:11:32+08	2025-09-06 02:12:33+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122244037262194106	https://www.facebook.com/12228