5af98457-9070-4476-897e-f2d086fc9610	𝗖𝗮𝗹𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶! 🎉	𝗖𝗮𝗹𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶! 🎉\n\nGet ready to reconnect and celebrate with us during the 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝟭𝟭𝟱𝘁𝗵 𝗙𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗔𝗻𝗻𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗮𝗿𝘆 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗚𝗿𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 𝗛𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗶𝗻𝗴! Don't miss this incredible opportunity to win amazing prizes on September 14-21, 2025. \n\n1st Door Prize: 𝗕𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗗-𝗡𝗘𝗪 𝗛𝗢𝗨𝗦𝗘 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗟𝗢𝗧! 🏠 \n\n👏 Special thanks to CMU College of Engineering Batch 1999\n\nHere's how to join and get a chance to win:\n1. Scan the QR Code or register online at https://tinyurl.com/cmu115reg\n2. Join the CMU@115 Founding Anniversary and Grand Alumni Homecoming Activities\n3. Be present during the draw for a chance to win!\n\n𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗻𝘁 𝗥𝗲𝗺𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗲𝗿𝘀:\n✅ This event is open to 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 (High School, Undergraduate, and Post-Graduate) only\n✅ The cut-off date for registrations is 𝗦𝗲𝗽𝘁𝗲𝗺𝗯𝗲𝗿 𝟭𝟱, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱, 𝗮𝘁 𝟱 𝗣𝗠\n\nTickets will be distributed to the registered participants starting 𝗔𝘂𝗴𝘂𝘀𝘁 𝟭𝟴, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱 at the CMU Alumni Association Inc. (CMU Fulbright Garden) or through your respective college and high school alumni coordinators.\n\nWe can't wait to see you there! 👋\n\nHouse and Lot Teaser Video: https://www.facebook.com/share/v/164EeCQYBS/\n\nFor inquiries, you may contact the office through alumnirelation@cmu.edu.ph. \nFollow us for more updates and amazing surprises! \n\n#CMUAlumni #GrandAlumniHomecoming #cmu115years #alumnievent #doorprizes\n\n𝗖𝗮𝗹𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶! 🎉\n\nGet ready to reconnect and celebrate with us during the 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝟭𝟭𝟱𝘁𝗵 𝗙𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗔𝗻𝗻𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗮𝗿𝘆 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗚𝗿𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 𝗛𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗶𝗻𝗴! Don't miss this incredible opportunity to win amazing prizes on September 14-21, 2025. \n\n1st Door Prize: 𝗕𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗗-𝗡𝗘𝗪 𝗛𝗢𝗨𝗦𝗘 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗟𝗢𝗧! 🏠 \n\n👏 Special thanks to CMU College of Engineering Batch 1999\n\nHere's how to join and get a chance to win:\n1. Scan the QR Code or register online at https://tinyurl.com/cmu115reg\n2. Join the CMU@115 Founding Anniversary and Grand Alumni Homecoming Activities\n3. Be present during the draw for a chance to win!\n\n𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗻𝘁 𝗥𝗲𝗺𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗲𝗿𝘀:\n✅ This event is open to 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 (High School, Undergraduate, and Post-Graduate) only\n✅ The cut-off date for registrations is 𝗦𝗲𝗽𝘁𝗲𝗺𝗯𝗲𝗿 𝟭𝟱, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱, 𝗮𝘁 𝟱 𝗣𝗠\n\nTickets will be distributed to the registered participants starting 𝗔𝘂𝗴𝘂𝘀𝘁 𝟭𝟴, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱 at the CMU Alumni Association Inc. (CMU Fulbright Garden) or through your respective college and high school alumni coordinators.\n\nWe can't wait to see you there! 👋\n\nHouse and Lot Teaser Video: https://www.facebook.com/share/v/164EeCQYBS/\n\nFor inquiries, you may contact the office through alumnirelation@cmu.edu.ph. \nFollow us for more updates and amazing surprises! \n\n#CMUAlumni #GrandAlumniHomecoming #cmu115years #alumnievent #doorprizes	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/527417108_1331603875641073_6940910419672029600_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=wv8SX6vxd0oQ7kNvwF7-XAE&_nc_oc=Adox4d8AnSxLq8VX39NKX-aCokzv_hGqWsd5C60UMJByXmlFBozf78fngzelUVqQpXc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQE2XDw-GiGvU22yzOF3Kwb5Q4TJ83ORVN-o49f-jOXijdKVY12-fOLankTNL5bkWagvvWoNGvsNvQ&oh=00_Af7KV9_dkxeu0nuYfvH-igJCpIwFRU2OCDf1RdaV9wXaPw&oe=6A01B125	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122238259220194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2025-08-01 12:16:04+08	\N	0	\N	2025-08-01 12:16:04+08	2025-08-01 12:16:04+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122238259220194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122238259220194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
