dadb4ce1-d03b-4b1f-9e0a-05cdfa72aec3	𝗛𝗘𝗔𝗗𝗦 𝗨𝗣!	𝗛𝗘𝗔𝗗𝗦 𝗨𝗣!\n𝙂𝙚𝙣𝙚𝙧𝙞𝙠𝙖 𝘿𝙧𝙪𝙜𝙨𝙩𝙤𝙧𝙚 𝙈𝙤𝙗𝙞𝙡𝙚 𝙇𝙖𝙗𝙤𝙧𝙖𝙩𝙤𝙧𝙮 𝙞𝙨 𝙞𝙣 𝘾𝙈𝙐 𝙁𝙪𝙡𝙗𝙧𝙞𝙜𝙝𝙩!\nJoin us on June 24, 2024 (8:00 AM) at Fulbright Garden, Central Mindanao University, Musuan, Maramag.\nVisit and avail the following services with an affordable package rate of  ₱𝟰𝟵𝟵.𝟬𝟬:\n1. 𝘾𝙧𝙚𝙖𝙩𝙞𝙣𝙞𝙣𝙚 - To check Kidney Function\n2. 𝗙𝗕𝗦 - To check blood sugar levels in relation to potential Diabetes Mellitus (DM)\n3. 𝗧𝗼𝘁𝗮𝗹 𝗖𝗵𝗼𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗼𝗹 - To check blood cholesterol level \n4. 𝗨𝗿𝗶𝗰 𝗔𝗰𝗶𝗱 - To check blood uric acid levels relative to development of Gout \n5. 𝗦𝗚𝗣𝗧 - To check potential Liver Damage \n6. 𝗨𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗮𝗹𝘆𝘀𝗶𝘀 - To rule our Urinary Tract Infection (UTI)\nFor those who wish to avail, please remember to 𝗙𝗔𝗦𝗧 \n𝟭𝟮 𝗵𝗼𝘂𝗿𝘀 𝗯𝗲𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗲 (8 PM, June 23, 2024) the Mobile Laboratory Service. \nSee you all there!\n\n𝗛𝗘𝗔𝗗𝗦 𝗨𝗣!\n\n𝙂𝙚𝙣𝙚𝙧𝙞𝙠𝙖 𝘿𝙧𝙪𝙜𝙨𝙩𝙤𝙧𝙚 𝙈𝙤𝙗𝙞𝙡𝙚 𝙇𝙖𝙗𝙤𝙧𝙖𝙩𝙤𝙧𝙮 𝙞𝙨 𝙞𝙣 𝘾𝙈𝙐 𝙁𝙪𝙡𝙗𝙧𝙞𝙜𝙝𝙩!\nJoin us on June 24, 2024 (8:00 AM) at Fulbright Garden, Central Mindanao University, Musuan, Maramag.\n\nVisit and avail the following services with an affordable package rate of  ₱𝟰𝟵𝟵.𝟬𝟬:\n1. 𝘾𝙧𝙚𝙖𝙩𝙞𝙣𝙞𝙣𝙚 - To check Kidney Function\n2. 𝗙𝗕𝗦 - To check blood sugar levels in relation to potential Diabetes Mellitus (DM)\n3. 𝗧𝗼𝘁𝗮𝗹 𝗖𝗵𝗼𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗼𝗹 - To check blood cholesterol level \n4. 𝗨𝗿𝗶𝗰 𝗔𝗰𝗶𝗱 - To check blood uric acid levels relative to development of Gout \n5. 𝗦𝗚𝗣𝗧 - To check potential Liver Damage \n6. 𝗨𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗮𝗹𝘆𝘀𝗶𝘀 - To rule our Urinary Tract Infection (UTI)\n\nFor those who wish to avail, please remember to 𝗙𝗔𝗦𝗧 \n𝟭𝟮 𝗵𝗼𝘂𝗿𝘀 𝗯𝗲𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗲 (8 PM, June 23, 2024) the Mobile Laboratory Service. \n\nSee you all there!	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/492362335_1244778470990281_5920668519993620856_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=7sam_VjtGwgQ7kNvwGvjFrI&_nc_oc=AdqigPdl6USVQrrubyDGLzLUmh525j75A9EPVhX9vO0EPG36LXNExHn0F0VIwiGZ5QY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQELL47sRc5yHyn7WZW6xyDQ50uWMTss