512eafbb-19ef-42a6-964b-12010597c228	𝗦𝗔𝗩𝗘 𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗗𝗔𝗧𝗘!	𝗦𝗔𝗩𝗘 𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗗𝗔𝗧𝗘!\n\nThe Central Mindanao University Alumni Association, Inc. in partnership with:\n\nCMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages\nCMU Hospital\nBukidnon Pharmaceutical Multi-purpose Cooperative - BUPHARCO\nKING ENERGY GENERATION INC.\nTAU GAMMA PHI FRATERNITY\nSIGMA RHO FRATERNITY\nCMU ORGASMS - Organization of Animal Science Major Students)\n\nwill spearhead the 𝟮𝗻𝗱 𝗢𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗧𝗨𝗟𝗜 𝗠𝗜𝗦𝗦𝗜𝗢𝗡 this coming 𝗠𝗮𝘆 𝟯𝟭, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟰 at University Hospital, CMU, Musuan.\n\nThis activity is open to all preschool and elementary school children within the community of Maramag, Bukidnon.\n\nTo get a slot, please come to the Fulbright Garden for registration, then proceed to the University Hospital for initial Screening.\n\nSee you there!\n\n#CMUAAIactivities\n#2ndOperationtuli2024\n#circumcised\n\n𝗦𝗔𝗩𝗘 𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗗𝗔𝗧𝗘!\n\nThe Central Mindanao University Alumni Association, Inc. in partnership with: \n\nCMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages\nCMU Hospital \nBukidnon Pharmaceutical Multi-purpose Cooperative - BUPHARCO \nKING ENERGY GENERATION INC. \nTAU GAMMA PHI FRATERNITY\nSIGMA RHO FRATERNITY \nCMU ORGASMS - Organization of Animal Science Major Students) \n\nwill spearhead the 𝟮𝗻𝗱 𝗢𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗧𝗨𝗟𝗜 𝗠𝗜𝗦𝗦𝗜𝗢𝗡 this coming 𝗠𝗮𝘆 𝟯𝟭, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟰 at University Hospital, CMU, Musuan. \n\nThis activity is open to all preschool and elementary school children within the community of Maramag, Bukidnon. \n\nTo get a slot, please come to the Fulbright Garden for registration, then proceed to the University Hospital for initial Screening. \n\nSee you there! \n\n#CMUAAIactivities \n#2ndOperationtuli2024\n #circumcised	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/491997001_1244119914389470_7751243654267741177_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=dAAlH2ILyvoQ7kNvwEyGD9Y&_nc_oc=Adp6CFUDmOXarSnTOLLGPRRqXGY8BHkbjn736owRb82cPqi7p4KBmEcZjuxP0wYFp-0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=