e2456b2d-6ab7-4765-a32d-75ed9c94aef6	[EARLIER TODAY] Central Mindanao University (CMU) held a Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Fence Project: Bayanihan Alang sa CMU—A Fence Project to Protect CMU and the Future on August 18, 2025, at CMU University Town, Musuan, Maramag, Bukidnon.	[EARLIER TODAY] Central Mindanao University (CMU) held a Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Fence Project: Bayanihan Alang sa CMU—A Fence Project to Protect CMU and the Future on August 18, 2025, at CMU University Town, Musuan, Maramag, Bukidnon. \n\nThis is a collaborative project by CMU Administration, CMUAAI, CMUEAI, CMUFAI, RGMO, OUPD, and OGS that demonstrates a unified commitment to safeguarding the university's land, resources, and community for future generations. \n\nThe Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages (OARL) facilitated the ceremony.\n\nPhotos from Central Mindanao University's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/534715433_1191251103047215_38145904946410983_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s1080x2048_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=yjgfLRxRoXsQ7kNvwGJNr1h&_nc_oc=Adp1vhLaHTXCoBlk-TwjptaXMtd3niMhWkGli4SMxmqVFcnsbOGDVXgA1S4T3t11aEU&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEShxH-86KyOCXfoNr69FSDuLNGaZY45Kz-uqDFD_jnZkjqGceUgCAEEZWqIEdX0_MjyhObF0oijQ&oh=00_Af424DhwwqzCGDu6Dgm5Y22-46CD7uagZ7v-eY0XJuZbTw&oe=6A01811E	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122240947652194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2025-08-18 07:13:24+08	\N	0	\N	2025-08-18 07:13:24+08	2025-08-18 09:50:27+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122240947652194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122240947652194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
