7d774dd3-bb1d-43a3-9e6f-57be40fc8e75	The CMU Alumni Association, Inc., in collaboration with the CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages, recently organized a successful Information Drive Caravan in Central Visayas from July 28 to August 2, 2024.	The CMU Alumni Association, Inc., in collaboration with the CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages, recently organized a successful Information Drive Caravan in Central Visayas from July 28 to August 2, 2024. \n\nWe would like to express our heartfelt gratitude to the University President Dr. Rolito G. Eballe, Vice President for Academic Affairs Dr. Jose S. Valmorida, and the entire CMU administration for their unwavering support and commitment to this initiative.\n\nA special thank you goes to CMU alumni Jefferson Cahayag in Cebu City and Federico Acuna for their warm welcome and hospitality. We are also grateful to all the Central Visayas CMU alumni who took the time to reconnect with us during the caravan.\n\nThrough this Information Drive Caravan, we have established new local chapters in Cebu City and Bohol, and have inducted their newly elected officers. This is a significant milestone for our CMU alumni community, as it strengthens our regional presence and fosters greater engagement among our graduates.\n\n#CMUAlumni #InformationDriveCaravan\n\nPhotos from CMU Alumni's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/493333999_1247202037414591_934901994321675231_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=dd6889&_nc_ohc=E4Mei6thv8kQ7kNvwE1I__g&_nc_oc=AdrOut-6eDSSo3hjjqDxBTHsRrQ4BK_rWnCCrAUOJmSEexI0Qfy3TGG9mFCXddG8HXQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQE5kbAD-QUZC6DYP2ezfYRzb_zAhLSrPvgV08P32whLkJJCPfqeyyZiqTnihbXRIwYZhDmKM-pudQ&oh=00_Af6gR93etONbWKxzvk8auGo2TKPznax5FmMHxpTUx_T4Dg&oe=6A01815D	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122168446682194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-08-1