9530692a-f9c6-4ef2-9c0a-3854f1b4272c	𝗜𝗻𝘃𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 𝘁𝗼 𝗣𝗮𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗽𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗶𝗻 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗤𝗦 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗿 𝗦𝘂𝗿𝘃𝗲𝘆 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗖𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗿𝗮𝗹 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗼 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗶𝘁𝘆 💚💛	𝗜𝗻𝘃𝗶𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 𝘁𝗼 𝗣𝗮𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗽𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗶𝗻 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗤𝗦 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗿 𝗦𝘂𝗿𝘃𝗲𝘆 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗖𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗿𝗮𝗹 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗼 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗶𝘁𝘆 💚💛\n\n[LOOK] Invitation to Participate in the QS Customer Survey for Central Mindanao University \n\nCentral Mindanao University is once again engaging with QS Ranking, endeavoring to uphold or even elevate its current 3-star status. At present, the university is undergoing a comprehensive evaluation process for potential inclusion in the QS Ranking.\n\nIn this regard, we are inviting you to participate in the QS Customer Survey for CMU. Your invaluable feedback holds immense significance in our pursuit of excellence and global recognition.\n\nYour insights and perspectives are pivotal in our efforts to identify and build upon CMU's strengths while addressing areas for improvement. By sharing your experiences and opinions through this survey, you play a direct role in shaping CMU's reputation and standing in the international education arena.\n\nWe understand that your time is precious, and we sincerely appreciate your willingness to dedicate a portion of it to completing this survey. Rest assured that all information provided will be treated with the utmost care and confidentiality. Your responses will be handled with the highest level of sensitivity and will solely be utilized to enhance CMU's performance and the quality of education we provide.\n\nTo access the survey, kindly utilize the link applicable to you:\n\nAlumni Survey : bit.ly/QSAlumniSurvey\nEmployee (Faculty & Staff) Survey : bit.ly/QSStaffSurvey\nStudent Survey: https://bit.ly/QSStudentSurvey\n\nThank you in advance for your invaluable participation and unwavering support. Together, let us strive towards excellence and further elevate the esteemed reputation of Central Mindanao University.\n\nLetter available here: https://rb.gy/v54q5r\n\n--\nInfo from the Office of Quality Assurance	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/485374322_1072498581589135_3814891569916629210_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=uaFpJA6gFjMQ7kNvwFtfDhX&_nc_oc=AdpBPPVP21Yz_fsQPq6NfraY5J3H4ovEN5nmgFuuaEILx9o9LiLh-hIVQgr3IBhP75Q&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQF2YVaRw4S0oAYlFEFUkBSqbiWgKH5aEWQOjXc5J1iEvvVkh_fJIH7BJpOE48_E18rsXHMWIKDNvw&oh=00_Af4mTU4sRwKiv6xdRct_VBQnPSYGpG7AUVnKW_MURH7PzA&oe=6A0196C6	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122159953664194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-07-08 11:56:25+08	\N	0	\N	2024-07-08 11:56:25+08	2024-07-08 12:22:44+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122159953664194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122159953664194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:05+08
fae38310-f27f-4182-975f-046b62fd9394	[ANNOUCEMENT] The Candidacy Filing Period for the CMUAAI Board of Trustees is now open!	[ANNOUCEMENT] The Candidacy Filing Period for the CMUAAI Board of Trustees is now open!\n\nWe are calling on all bona fide and active members of the CMU Alumni Association, Inc. to consider running for a position on the Board. This is your chance to lead and shape the future of our alumni community.\n\nThe filing period will run from August 15-25, 2025\n\nTo apply, please submit the following documents to the CMUAAI Office:\n• A completed Election Form: https://tinyurl.com/aaielectionform1\n• Any proof certifying that you are a graduate of CMU\n• CSC Personal Data Sheet: https://tinyurl.com/01pds\n\nFor any questions, you can contact the CMUAAI Office via email at cmuaai@cmu.edu.ph or call 0906-049-3212.\n\n[ANNOUCEMENT] The Candidacy Filing Period for the CMUAAI Board of Trustees is now open!\n\nWe are calling on all bona fide and active members of the CMU Alumni Association, Inc. to consider running for a position on the Board. This is your chance to lead and shape the future of our alumni community.\n\nThe filing period will run from August 15-25, 2025\n\nTo apply, please submit the following documents to the CMUAAI Office:\n• A completed Election Form: https://tinyurl.com/aaielectionform1\n• Any proof certifying that you are a graduate of CMU\n• CSC Personal Data Sheet: https://tinyurl.com/01pds\n\nFor any questions, you can contact the CMUAAI Office via email at cmuaai@cmu.edu.ph or call 0906-049-3212.	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/532016108_1344477007687093_3559046650572322514_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=dd6889&_nc_ohc=iZnhbKxii00Q7kNvwGEZhX2&_nc_oc=Adqr2InDDk_K6B2N62cmfbKreai785XEYAIWFqJTzx_E_Q4Ku1DgbCQWTjYzCjUegbs&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQFibTidXX9aSXA3H9aSiQnNK4aK4b_YgjmBACdV_HRT6ADGpstPsnW