42fbea99-4f7b-4f0b-9317-35deb8a88f16	𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗜𝗡𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗠𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗚𝗨𝗜𝗗𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘,	𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗜𝗡𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗠𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗚𝗨𝗜𝗗𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘,\nPlease refer to the link/photo below to accomplish your request: https://arlo.cmu.edu.ph/\n\nGeneral instructions:\n1. Go to our service website https://arlo.cmu.edu.ph and choose the category of concern \n- General Clearance\n- Tracer Verification\n- CMUAAI Membership\n\n2. Complete the listed requirements and submit them by clicking the submit button. \n\nWait for our email reply to confirm your request. Thank you.\n\n𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗜𝗡𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗠𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗚𝗨𝗜𝗗𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘,\nPlease refer to the link/photo below to accomplish your request: https://arlo.cmu.edu.ph/\n\nGeneral instructions:\n1. Go to our service website https://arlo.cmu.edu.ph and choose the category of concern \n- General Clearance\n- Tracer Verification\n- CMUAAI Membership\n\n2. Complete the listed requirements and submit them by clicking the submit button. \n\nWait for our email reply to confirm your request. Thank you.	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/474842967_122200771004194106_8975522121742746022_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=Lnb5wfg6l3IQ7kNvwE8BSo-&_nc_oc=AdpkkZMlvGkn03nnrDcorg637-8__pNNJvFpAoI20VC8M_qfyL1K1qQjXGm07myHpx0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEz1p4oI7SR2aa_pHKk4ShVzRqbORJXt4qv158TzL48EdxmEqU1njJYK9IguK3P0GLTaw1a9obKhQ&oh=00_Af6ZFJ8NJTIvakJ9mqyxF9s2_cxFruZnHB5G6lyVzK-8Qg&oe=6A018B09	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122150246666194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-05-28 08:56:55+08	\N	0	\N	2024-05-28 08:56:55+08	2025-02-18 07:13:49+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122150246666194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122150246666194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:05+08
cc928a11-4f34-41f9-8a1f-f7b0932496e2	Facebook Page Update	In celebration of National Women’s Month 2026, we recognize the strength, leadership, and enduring contributions of Filipinas in shaping a just and equitable society. Inspired by the theme “Lead like the Babaylans, Filipinas!”, we honor the historical role of women as leaders, healers, and guardians of community wisdom.\n\nThe Philippine legal framework affirms this commitment through landmark laws that protect the rights, dignity, and welfare of women. Among these are the Magna Carta of Women (R.A. 9710), which serves as the country’s comprehensive women’s human rights law; the Safe Spaces Act (R.A. 11313), which safeguards individuals from gender based harassment in public spaces, workplaces, schools, and online platforms; the Anti Violence Against Women and Their Children Act (R.A. 9262), which provides protection and remedies against various forms of abuse; and the Responsible Parenthood and Reproductive Health Act (R.A. 10354), which ensures access to reproductive health information and services.\n\nThese laws remind us that gender equality is not only a social aspiration but also a legal commitment. As members of the legal community, we continue to uphold justice, protect human rights, and strengthen institutions that promote equality and dignity for all.\n\nLet us continue to empower women, advance workplace equity, and build a society where fairness and opportunity are shared by everyone.\n\n#NationalWomensMonth\n#LeadLikeTheBabaylans\n#GenderEquality\n#SDG5\n#SustainableDevelopmentGoals\n#WomenEmpowerment\n#JusticeForAll\n#LegalAwareness\n#RuleOfLaw\n#PhilippineLaw\n#EmpowerWomen\n#WorkplaceEquity\n#FairnessForAll	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/645726020_122166723794900674_5721172405315486181_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7b2446&_nc_ohc=Tc0BqTmSik0Q7kNvwEJObv6&_nc_oc=AdohU_KOx4y6QeNG9QI4XMBGTfRG87yOBngZWVkO__d2glZS_sGXwVtOuykD3e3SjvM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQGI59uKhs1pXILdYoOo136HwQHMdLJpJRSqGsU5Pugko3VxPq7Y1AZZtbQtKU6psjMo6XgGQXxeRA&oh=00_Af5Qz_4GfVmoBUV7eFaPEiIl2lxNRiFHtnVct9uecGBDnQ&oe=6A0191DB	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122271877934194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2026-03-04 06:28:11+08	\N	1	\N	2026-03-04 06:28:11+08	2026-03-04 06:28:11+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122271877934194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122271877934194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
