b29f65e2-4abb-463e-9758-c6b1e01acd2f	𝓢𝓽𝓻𝓮𝓷𝓰𝓽𝓱𝓮𝓷𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓒𝓜𝓤 𝓝𝓾𝓻𝓼𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓔𝔁𝓬𝓮𝓵𝓵𝓮𝓷𝓬𝓮 𝓽𝓱𝓻𝓸𝓾𝓰𝓱 𝓐𝓵𝓾𝓶𝓷𝓲 𝓔𝓷𝓰𝓪𝓰𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽 𝓪𝓷𝓭 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓽𝓲𝓷𝓾𝓸𝓾𝓼 𝓛𝓮𝓪𝓻𝓷𝓲𝓷𝓰	𝓢𝓽𝓻𝓮𝓷𝓰𝓽𝓱𝓮𝓷𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓒𝓜𝓤 𝓝𝓾𝓻𝓼𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓔𝔁𝓬𝓮𝓵𝓵𝓮𝓷𝓬𝓮 𝓽𝓱𝓻𝓸𝓾𝓰𝓱 𝓐𝓵𝓾𝓶𝓷𝓲 𝓔𝓷𝓰𝓪𝓰𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽 𝓪𝓷𝓭 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓽𝓲𝓷𝓾𝓸𝓾𝓼 𝓛𝓮𝓪𝓻𝓷𝓲𝓷𝓰\n\nToday, February 2, 2026, the Central Mindanao University – College of Nursing successfully conducted its Continuing Education Program and Post-Philippine Nursing Licensure Exam (PNLE) Evaluation, a meaningful gathering aimed at advancing professional development, reflective learning, and constructive feedback to further strengthen the CMU Nursing Program and empower future graduates.\n\nThis activity was made even more significant with the strong support of the Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages (OARL), led by its Director, 𝘼𝙩𝙩𝙮. 𝙅𝙖𝙢𝙚𝙨 𝙈. 𝙑𝙞𝙤𝙡𝙤𝙣, who ensured that our valued CMU College of Nursing alumni were properly recognized and engaged, reinforcing enduring alumni ties and strengthening the University’s relationship with its graduates.\n\nWith the presence and initiatives of the Alumni Linkage, the program also highlighted CMU’s commitment to recruitment, job placement, and career support for our newly licensed nurses, ensuring that our newly minted Registered Nurses are guided not only by excellence in training but also by stronger professional networks.\n\nWe gratefully acknowledge the dedicated leadership and support of:\n🌟 𝘿𝙧. 𝙀𝙡𝙡𝙚𝙣 𝙂𝙖𝙮 𝙎. 𝙄𝙩𝙝𝙤𝙣𝙜, 𝘿𝙈, 𝙍𝙉, Dean, College of Nursing, for her inspiring welcome remarks and steadfast leadership;\n🌟 𝘿𝙧. 𝙅𝙤𝙚 𝙎. 𝙑𝙖𝙡𝙢𝙤𝙧𝙞𝙙𝙖, Vice President for Academic Affairs, for his key institutional insights and continuing support to academic excellence; and\n🌟 𝘿𝙧. 𝙍𝙤𝙡𝙞𝙩𝙤 𝙂. 𝙀𝙗𝙖𝙡𝙡𝙚, University President, for his continued guidance and unwavering commitment to strengthening CMU’s academic and professional programs.\n\nWe likewise commend the collective efforts of the College of Nursing faculty, staff, students, and alumni whose participation and commitment continue to uphold the proud standards of CMU Nursing.\n\nCongratulations to our passers and new Registered Nurses! Your success is a victory shared by the entire CMU community. 💛💚\n\n#CMUCollegeOfNursing #AcademicParadiseoftheSouth\n#CMUAlumniRelationsAndLinkages #PNLEPassers\n#NursingExcellence #CMUProud\n\nPhotos from CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/624861952_122267532032194106_8105342632561932188_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=Oqn56jE2xhkQ7kNvwEVMSKk&_nc_oc=AdogfqjtO_nisMS_QAWkxX5K1bmtkzOlvbECHi4DZzHScWUtbf_JHldh-f_-RK9AoOc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQETsNvObd9Dxo2G5eG2G8mH8ZDtf8g3syC11UE4f95qd9a60jCOxSLmnB6cwjA4_EMX9osfs9CL0Q&oh=00_Af6WZHe4J-nJl24tPV68ZEwzh6Z9Am1_DtST-KKhnGIBKA&oe=6A01A93B	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122267532164194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2026-02-02 06:25:08+08	\N	0	\N	2026-02-02 06:25:08+08	2026-02-02 06:25:08+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122267532164194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122267532164194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
