f05ed5bf-40a4-410f-8864-622388fb90d1	Facebook Page Update	📢𝐍𝐎𝐓𝐈𝐂𝐄 𝐎𝐅 𝐇𝐈𝐑𝐈𝐍𝐆📢\n\n𝐎𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐞 𝐀𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭: Office of the Vice President for Academic Affairs\n\n𝐄𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐨𝐲𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐬: Job Order \n\n𝐑𝐨𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐑𝐞𝐬𝐩𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐞𝐬:\n1. Handle the monitoring of the monthly Performance/Accomplishments of the Deans of the College and Head of Units and response/compliance with external requirements (e.g. CHED, PASUC, and LGU Linkages).\n2. Prepare and consolidate reports (monthly, quarterly, semi-annual, and annual) for submission to the Office of the President and other agencies.\n3. Re-check documentary requirements of faculty (teaching load, communication, etc.)\n4. Do basic lay-outing of programs and tarpaulins for occasions and events.\n5. Handle database in instruction for faster access, correctness, credibility and validity of data for release and use by the different offices of the university.\n6. Collate data on the monitoring of effectiveness of action plans (strategic plans) by the colleges and offices under OVPAA for better decision-making benchmarks and administrative utilization.\n\nInterested applicants may submit their application to the Office of Human Resource Management addressed to the University President thru the OHRM Director.  \n\n𝐏𝐨𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐚𝐭𝐞: 𝐉𝐮𝐥𝐲 𝟏𝟔, 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟒 \n𝐂𝐥𝐨𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐚𝐭𝐞: 𝐉𝐮𝐥𝐲 𝟐𝟔, 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟒\n\nDisclaimer:\nThe Central Mindanao University - Office of the Human Resource and Management encourages all interested and qualified applicants, including persons with disability, members of Indigenous communities, and those with diverse sexual orientations gender identities, and expressions.	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/472846500_122146930226328858_7361395707003472319_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=CoMRZ__k5tIQ7kNvwFbGPQH&_nc_oc=AdrOQ1XgZpnBLozNqNXstNeKu4q4cVkP7D01KKBXIswcUscFf4KCcs_fOgWV1s_yw3M&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQFn