70dcb88e-e308-4663-b9a8-34b0a49a4f22	[𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗨𝗟𝗧𝗦 𝗔𝗥𝗘 𝗢𝗨𝗧] Central Mindanao University is pleased to announce the result of CMUCAT for AY 2024-2025. If you are one of the takers of this entrance examination you can now view the results at https://www.cmu.edu.ph/list-of-cmucat-qualifiers-ay-2	[𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗨𝗟𝗧𝗦 𝗔𝗥𝗘 𝗢𝗨𝗧] Central Mindanao University is pleased to announce the result of CMUCAT for AY 2024-2025. If you are one of the takers of this entrance examination you can now view the results at https://www.cmu.edu.ph/list-of-cmucat-qualifiers-ay-2024-2025/\n\nViewing of your actual raw score and other necessary documents needed during enrollment will be available starting May 27, 2024. Please wait for an announcement soon!\n\nVideo tutorial on how to register and view your results at https://www.facebook.com/CMUOASP/videos/283118069486263/?t=45\n\nCongratulations and welcome to Central Mindanao University!\n\n[𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗨𝗟𝗧𝗦 𝗔𝗥𝗘 𝗢𝗨𝗧] Central Mindanao University is pleased to announce the result of CMUCAT for AY 2024-2025. If you are one of the takers of this entrance examination you can now view the results at https://www.cmu.edu.ph/list-of-cmucat-qualifiers-ay-2024-2025/\n\nAlternate link: https://shorturl.at/4ianS\n\nViewing of your actual raw score and other necessary documents needed during enrollment will be available starting May 27, 2024. Please wait for an announcement soon!\n\nVideo tutorial on how to register and view your results at https://www.facebook.com/CMUOASP/videos/283118069486263/?t=45\n\nCongratulations and welcome to Central Mindanao University!	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/487404250_1077554551083538_1958382967692874000_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7b2446&_nc_ohc=g-wbzeM3ZuQQ7kNvwEedfrT&_nc_oc=Adrau1qwgnol9lz33BVvsP2oslJf4vraQcki9mbebGQM0-wiwwFAGiOlmxTIjfta7U4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQE5KQrXLcM3QBj34W4LbM6SjG