2c9d31d4-5631-4ffc-a386-18e550bccbe7	📣 𝐖𝐄 𝐀𝐑𝐄 𝐇𝐈𝐑𝐈𝐍𝐆!	📣 𝐖𝐄 𝐀𝐑𝐄 𝐇𝐈𝐑𝐈𝐍𝐆!\n\n𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐂𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐥 𝐌𝐢𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐨 𝐔𝐧𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐲 – 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐥 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐰 𝐢𝐬 𝐥𝐨𝐨𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐭𝐡𝐫𝐞𝐞 (𝟑) 𝐎𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐞 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐟𝐟 (𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐜𝐭 𝐨𝐟 𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞).\n\n𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬:\n✔ 𝐆𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐁𝐒 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐓𝐞𝐜𝐡𝐧𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐠𝐲/𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐒𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐦𝐬\n✔ 𝐁𝐒 𝐎𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐞 𝐀𝐝𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 / 𝐀𝐁 𝐨𝐫 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐜𝐞-𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐭𝐨 𝐁𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐀𝐝𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 & 𝐌𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐠𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭\n✔ 𝐎𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐫 𝐜𝐨𝐮𝐫𝐬𝐞𝐬 𝐦𝐚𝐲 𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐥𝐥 𝐚𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐲\n✔ 𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐠𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐰𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐛𝐚𝐥 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐦𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐬𝐤𝐢𝐥𝐥𝐬\n✔ 𝐓𝐞𝐚𝐜𝐡𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐚𝐝𝐚𝐩𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞\n\n𝐒𝐮𝐛𝐦𝐢𝐭 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐟𝐨𝐥𝐥𝐨𝐰𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐫𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬:\n📌 𝐀𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐞𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐚𝐝𝐝𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐭𝐨:\n𝐃𝐫. 𝐑𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐨 𝐆. 𝐄𝐛𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞, 𝐔𝐧𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐧𝐭\n(𝐓𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡: 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐲. 𝐉𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐬 𝐌. 𝐕𝐢𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐧, 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐢𝐫, 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐥 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐰 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐦𝐢𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐞)\n📌 𝐓𝐎𝐑\n📌 𝐏𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥 𝐃𝐚𝐭𝐚 𝐒𝐡𝐞𝐞𝐭 / 𝐂𝐮𝐫𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐮𝐥𝐮𝐦 𝐕𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐞\n📌 𝐂𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐬\n\n📩 𝐒𝐞𝐧𝐝 𝐲𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐚𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐭𝐨: 𝐣𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐬.𝐯𝐢𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐧@𝐜𝐦𝐮.𝐞𝐝𝐮.𝐩𝐡 \n\n𝐉𝐨𝐢𝐧 𝐮𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐛𝐞 𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐨𝐟 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐰𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐂𝐌𝐔 𝐒𝐜𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐥 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐰 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐦𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐭𝐲!\n\nPhotos from CMU- School of Law's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/640042736_122123231133154067_6883652153237702607_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=dwcNtW8-AdMQ7kNvwFoPLCY&_nc_oc=AdrkTsE4Gl5xSy7zX-Gm3jUTvFaOvXccn1f3WMrEBJxuibFT6J53hN4I0fq9RhQwP7k&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQFWcXU6LmaA1y7eMZKuyV3jYayxzOsmN3lUuo1iYaUiEtdWgk4-jJs8dzWl4altUCx0okkPG4Conw&oh=00_Af6Z7r9Q2XV6N6eaUIqyj4dm4u-bdSxDb6qHHS59WSh-FA&oe=6A0187C0	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122270532524194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2026-02-23 07:33:54+08	\N	0	\N	2026-02-23 07:33:54+08	2026-02-23 07:33:54+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122270532524194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122270532524194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
fc12a66e-2333-4a07-9e6c-d0d06b0c5ab5	Hello, College of Engineering, wherever you may be in the world. We urge you to take a moment to fill out this form so we can connect and update each other.	Hello, College of Engineering, wherever you may be in the world. We urge you to take a moment to fill out this form so we can connect and update each other. \n\nKnow that your Alma Mater misses you so much💚💛\n\n📢 𝗢𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗮𝗹 𝗔𝗻𝗻𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗰𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁\n\nThe 𝗖𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗲𝗴𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝗘𝗻𝗴𝗶𝗻𝗲𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴, in coordination with 𝗖𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗿𝗮𝗹 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗼 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗶𝘁𝘆, through the 𝗢𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 𝗥𝗲𝗹𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗟𝗶𝗻𝗸𝗮𝗴𝗲𝘀 (𝗢𝗔𝗥𝗟), is conducting the annual Unified Tracer Survey as part of its continuing efforts to assess graduate outcomes and enhance academic programs and services.\n\nFor this year, the tracer survey will primarily focus on the 2024 graduates of the College of Engineering.\n\nAll 2024 graduates are respectfully requested to accomplish the Unified Tracer Form through the link provided below:\n\n🔗 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗲𝗱 𝗧𝗿𝗮𝗰𝗲𝗿 𝗙𝗼𝗿𝗺:\ntinyurl.com/CMUOARLTracerForm\n\nAll information gathered will be treated with strict confidentiality and will be used solely for academic evaluation, program improvement, and institutional development purposes.\n\nWe also encourage everyone to help disseminate this announcement to fellow 2024 graduates to ensure wider participation.\n\nThank you for your cooperation and continued support of the College of Engineering and Central Mindanao University.	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/632560759_1506207194846577_25195456486466183_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=EMaezKqC0KgQ7kNvwG4oau0&_nc_oc=AdpCChk-G7poiKo_0vIjPMBPB66NZzxW4RtuFH8tfkn_TaNSALUFJPEfNdbfuIRcE5g&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQHHBIyn9j1euiGkMi9VhWJea4xP-5CRa2LtnSAmfc_SGD3GSuRJSJWJEZLpb-HqqIvHTylUHiC8zg&oh=00_Af4LXDc94TK7UfYMnV_bhxLCwXyjNcw8asL82pffAFkc6w&oe=6A0187B3	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122270101658194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2026-02-20 04:28:41+08	\N	0	\N	2026-02-20 04:28:41+08	2026-02-20 04:28:41+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122270101658194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122270101658194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
3e18d438-a6a5-488f-86df-be4f4dc90ed4	Happiest Birthday to our CMUAAI President, Dr. Louella Marciales Cabahug. May your day be filled with joy, laughter, and all the things you love. We wish you all the blessings and success in life. 💛🎂	Happiest Birthday to our CMUAAI President, Dr. Louella Marciales Cabahug. May your day be filled with joy, laughter, and all the things you love. We wish you all the blessings and success in life. 💛🎂\n\nHappiest Birthday to our CMUAAI President, Dr. Louella Marciales Cabahug. May your day be filled with joy, laughter, and all the things you love. We wish you all the blessings and success in life. 💛🎂	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/492399058_1245698654231596_1488826296283220676_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=oauESlZWcTMQ7kNvwFYUIXp&_nc_oc=AdqUqKqj31idNTLSNuj4OZsy0RYXhkSX29leTmIJCFIZAruiZhPq5-FX68Gz2vlh3s0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQHRkt8_1x5U4bHD1t7sB_vqJ9XoVjCn-iW8k9vzsWc-LLkjq_ZYbW-9n49BozFOBtgb7SKABXdq2A&oh=00_Af7PzLpgCb_G3h9PBS1FnzgoA2bNkyMskvelC9X6LK598g&oe=6A0191F0	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122160309338194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-07-10 01:49:13+08	\N	0	\N	2024-07-10 01:49:13+08	2024-07-10 02:02:23+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122160309338194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122160309338194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:05+08
95ecd25c-e924-4c29-ab04-f5ec6e50a1bd	𝙇𝙚𝙖𝙙𝙚𝙧𝙨𝙝𝙞𝙥 𝙞𝙣 𝙖𝙘𝙩𝙞𝙤𝙣!	𝙇𝙚𝙖𝙙𝙚𝙧𝙨𝙝𝙞𝙥 𝙞𝙣 𝙖𝙘𝙩𝙞𝙤𝙣!\n\nAtty. James M. Violon, Director of the OARL, convened a strategic meeting with the College and Laboratory High School Alumni Coordinators on February 11, 2026, to discuss and finalize the mechanics and criteria for the various collegiate competitions in preparation for the upcoming Unified Foundation Day and Alumni Homecoming this September.\n\nAtty. Violon emphasized the importance of early and proactive preparation to ensure the University can roll out exciting, well-organized activities that will truly engage and entice alumni to participate and come home for this much-anticipated celebration. He underscored the need to intensify promotional efforts and to actively lobby initiatives that will advance the interests and welfare of the alumni community.\n\nHe further highlighted his commitment to align and harmonize all efforts with the direction and vision of Dr. Rolito G. Eballe’s administration, ensuring that every activity reflects the University’s goals of unity, excellence, and stronger alumni engagement.\n\nWith strong leadership and collaborative planning, this year’s Unified Foundation Day and Alumni Homecoming promises to be bigger, better, and more meaningful for everyone. Stay tuned!\n\n#UnifiedFoundation\n#alumnihomecoming2026\n#OARLInitiatives\n#StrongerAlumniEngagement\n#UniversityUnity\n#EarlyPreparation\n#CollegiateCompetitions\n#AlumniCoordinators\n#OneUniversity\n#AdvancingAlumniWelfare 🎉\n\nPhotos from CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/634204581_122269176686194106_9209393309571395598_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=SZkgnJRaNAoQ7kNvwEVlrVL&_nc_oc=AdoU-l6GAMnaH5Tmmu_OPd7SP6jshi-PP07jXoudKU79KsXreuEHisaFXQbjpE1x4mQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQHmu1pDVxPM05_aLmEThovt