aa5d2454-d7cd-46b6-b725-2a63365dd15d	🔥💚💛 ᑭᖇEᑭᗩᖇE ᖴOᖇ ᑕᗰᑌ ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᕼOᗰEᑕOᗰIᑎG 2026! 💛💚🔥	🔥💚💛 ᑭᖇEᑭᗩᖇE ᖴOᖇ ᑕᗰᑌ ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᕼOᗰEᑕOᗰIᑎG 2026! 💛💚🔥\n\nThe Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages (OARL) is pleased to announce the upcoming Central Mindanao University Alumni Homecoming 2026, to be held in September 2026. This much-anticipated celebration will once again bring together CMU alumni across generations in a meaningful gathering of fellowship, pride, and shared legacy.\n\nThis year, alumni and stakeholders may look forward to an exciting and highly competitive lineup among the 11 Colleges, further enriched by the establishment of two new colleges that emerged from the former College of Arts and Sciences, featuring the following major highlights:\n\n1. KᗩᒪᗩYO: TᕼE 1st ᑕᗰᑌ ᖴᒪᗩᗰEᖴEᔕT 2026🔥\n(Ṡẗüḋëṅẗ–Äḷüṁṅï Ṁäṡṡ Ḋäṅċë Ċöṁṗëẗïẗïöṅ)\n\n2. ᗷIᗪᒪIᔕIᗯ: ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᕼOᗰEᑕOᗰIᑎG ᒪIᐯE ᑕOᑎᑕEᖇT ᔕᑭEᑕTᗩᑕᑌᒪᗩᖇ 🎶💃🕺👯‍♀️👯‍♂️\n(Á ńíǵht őf ḿúśíć, ĺíǵhtś, áńd ĆḾŰ ṕŕídé)\n\n3. ᗰ᙭. ᑕᗰᑌ ᑭᖇIᗪE ᖇOYᗩᒪE 2026\n(ḶĠḄṪQ+ Öṗëṅ Äḷüṁṅï Ċöṛöṅäẗïöṅ Ṅïġḧẗ)\n\n4. ᗰIᔕᔕ ᑕᗰᑌ ᗩᒪᒪ-ᔕTᗩᖇᔕ: ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᒪEGEᑎᗪᔕ EᗪITIOᑎ 2026\n(Ṫḧë Ḧöṁëċöṁïṅġ öḟ Ṗäṡẗ ĊṀÜ Qüëëṅṡ öṅ Öṅë Ġṛäṅḋ Ṡẗäġë)\n\n5. P̳̿͟͞U̳̿͟͞K̳̿͟͞S̳̿͟͞A̳̿͟͞A̳̿͟͞N̳̿͟͞: T̳̿͟͞h̳̿͟͞e̳̿͟͞ G̳̿͟͞r̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞n̳̿͟͞d̳̿͟͞ F̳̿͟͞l̳̿͟͞o̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞t̳̿͟͞ C̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞r̳̿͟͞n̳̿͟͞i̳̿͟͞v̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞l̳̿͟͞ 🌟\n(Ćőĺĺéǵé Ćőúńćíĺ áńd Áĺúḿńí śhőẃdőẃń)\n\nUnder the leadership of the newly designated 𝙘𝙤𝙣𝙘𝙪𝙧𝙧𝙚𝙣𝙩 𝘿𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩𝙤𝙧 𝙤𝙛 𝙊𝘼𝙍𝙇, 𝘼𝙩𝙩𝙮. 𝙅𝙖𝙢𝙚𝙨 𝙈. 𝙑𝙞𝙤𝙡𝙤𝙣, who likewise serves as the University Legal Counsel and Chairperson of the University Housing and Relocation Committee (UHRC), the OARL expresses its profound gratitude to God and to the dedicated coordinators and focal persons of Central Mindanao University for their commitment and collaborative efforts in making this celebration truly remarkable.\n\nThe CMU Alumni Homecoming 2026 is more than a reunion. It is a celebration of identity, institutional pride, and the enduring excellence of the CMU community.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming all CMU alumni and partners as we celebrate together.\n\n#CentralMindanaoUniversity #AlumniHomecoming2026 #AcademicParadiseoftheSouth #AlumniRelationsAndLinkages #AlumniPasabog\n\n🔥💚💛 ᑭᖇEᑭᗩᖇE ᖴOᖇ ᑕᗰᑌ ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᕼOᗰEᑕOᗰIᑎG 2026! 💛💚🔥\n\nThe Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages (OARL) is pleased to announce the upcoming Central Mindanao University Alumni Homecoming 2026, to be held in September 2026. This much-anticipated celebration will once again bring together CMU alumni across generations in a meaningful gathering of fellowship, pride, and shared legacy.\n\nThis year, alumni and stakeholders may look forward to an exciting and highly competitive lineup among the 11 Colleges, further enriched by the establishment of two new colleges that emerged from the former College of Arts and Sciences, featuring the following major highlights:\n\n1. KᗩᒪᗩYO: TᕼE 1st ᑕᗰᑌ ᖴᒪᗩᗰEᖴEᔕT 2026🔥\n(Ṡẗüḋëṅẗ–Äḷüṁṅï Ṁäṡṡ Ḋäṅċë Ċöṁṗëẗïẗïöṅ)\n\n2. ᗷIᗪᒪIᔕIᗯ: ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᕼOᗰEᑕOᗰIᑎG ᒪIᐯE ᑕOᑎᑕEᖇT ᔕᑭEᑕTᗩᑕᑌᒪᗩᖇ 🎶💃🕺👯‍♀️👯‍♂️\n(Á ńíǵht őf ḿúśíć, ĺíǵhtś, áńd ĆḾŰ ṕŕídé)\n\n3. ᗰ᙭. ᑕᗰᑌ ᑭᖇIᗪE ᖇOYᗩᒪE 2026\n(ḶĠḄṪQ+ Öṗëṅ Äḷüṁṅï Ċöṛöṅäẗïöṅ Ṅïġḧẗ)\n\n4. ᗰIᔕᔕ ᑕᗰᑌ ᗩᒪᒪ-ᔕTᗩᖇᔕ: ᗩᒪᑌᗰᑎI ᒪEGEᑎᗪᔕ EᗪITIOᑎ 2026\n(Ṫḧë Ḧöṁëċöṁïṅġ öḟ Ṗäṡẗ ĊṀÜ Qüëëṅṡ öṅ Öṅë Ġṛäṅḋ Ṡẗäġë)\n\n5. P̳̿͟͞U̳̿͟͞K̳̿͟͞S̳̿͟͞A̳̿͟͞A̳̿͟͞N̳̿͟͞: T̳̿͟͞h̳̿͟͞e̳̿͟͞ G̳̿͟͞r̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞n̳̿͟͞d̳̿͟͞ F̳̿͟͞l̳̿͟͞o̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞t̳̿͟͞ C̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞r̳̿͟͞n̳̿͟͞i̳̿͟͞v̳̿͟͞a̳̿͟͞l̳̿͟͞ 🌟\n(Ćőĺĺéǵé Ćőúńćíĺ áńd Áĺúḿńí śhőẃdőẃń)\n\nUnder the leadership of the newly designated 𝙘𝙤𝙣𝙘𝙪𝙧𝙧𝙚𝙣𝙩 𝘿𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩𝙤𝙧 𝙤𝙛 𝙊𝘼𝙍𝙇, 𝘼𝙩𝙩𝙮. 𝙅𝙖𝙢𝙚𝙨 𝙈. 𝙑𝙞𝙤𝙡𝙤𝙣, who likewise serves as the University Legal Counsel and Chairperson of the University Housing and Relocation Committee (UHRC), the OARL expresses its profound gratitude to God and to the dedicated coordinators and focal persons of Central Mindanao University for their commitment and collaborative efforts in making this celebration truly remarkable.\n\nThe CMU Alumni Homecoming 2026 is more than a reunion. It is a celebration of identity, institutional pride, and the enduring excellence of the CMU community.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming all CMU alumni and partners as we celebrate together.\n\n#CentralMindanaoUniversity #AlumniHomecoming2026 #AcademicParadiseoftheSouth #AlumniRelationsAndLinkages #AlumniPasabog	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/624910596_122267274374194106_4715553879093132498_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7b2446&_nc_ohc=XZdytYFCkGYQ7kNvwHjt4PF&_nc_oc=AdobTa6ilnfEBSyWDiLBsGaH8Qau3QIWKL2MQRx95IpC_iFfc4X_yCIkmj1dMhoCPzQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEkf2Yqbk2lLi12XewhUlDKSo3QW1mNuUfF50S4QaE96gbRN0dTdb8_02gUm6Ow5e7Z4vzWOvaSqw&oh=00_Af4knt02VvUmbZz-PJfPDQCWNyuybTymnM7UHak-B7e5rQ&oe=6A0193FB	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122267276030194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2026-01-31 09:23:10+08	\N	0	\N	2026-01-31 09:23:10+08	2026-02-01 05:34:36+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122267276030194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122267276030194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
cfc5c34d-22df-4b14-a778-e8faeef602e6	In celebration of the 115th Founding Anniversary of Central Mindanao University, the CMU Alumni Association, in partnership with Muspo Series, proudly presents:	In celebration of the 115th Founding Anniversary of Central Mindanao University, the CMU Alumni Association, in partnership with Muspo Series, proudly presents:\n\n🎉 CMU Alumni Homecoming Trail Run 2025 🎉\nLet’s reignite the spirit and relive the memories—on the trails!\nThis event brings together past and present in a celebration of fitness, friendship, and school pride.\nCome home, hit the trail, and make new memories where it all began.\n\nOpen to ALL—Alumni, Students, and Trail Running Enthusiasts!\n\n🏃 Distance Categories:\n27KM | 17KM | 7KM | 3KM\n\n📅 Date: September 14, 2025\n📍 Venue: Central Mindanao University Campus\n\n👉 Don’t miss this milestone event—register now!\n#115thCMUAlumniHomecoming #CentralMindanaoUniversity #MuspoSeries	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/501159239_122161307996512791_6270812376869073028_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=wsS_HQukp2oQ7kNvwF0x1SS&_nc_oc=AdpNnVqZZyRR0VfaIEX5VsJ9vhOc6im10_kD3SQNkUqnUYAQakKndTO555nBohwE4ss&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQFZ0M__mrFWUXI4HqXiiHBng_NHKdHq0--yomUWLPEq-Wcl8AFnhtQHp9-C5ReniZHrJVQ20dcv9w&oh=00_Af6mjXDsb4IQilaSw-YTFeuQ4GQWEdd5QPFYiGDEC3QCZQ&oe=6A019EC6	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122228028392194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2025-06-02 10:43:34+08	\N	0	\N	2025-06-02 10:43:34+08	2025-06-02 10:43:34+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122228028392194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122228028392194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
