28bca231-1eb0-4c49-979d-fddc93be9ef4	𝗔𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 ‼️📣	𝗔𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 ‼️📣\n\nRFTG Law Office is seeking a qualified Legal Secretary to join their team in Maramag, Bukidnon! \n\n𝗤𝘂𝗮𝗹𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀:\n• Preferably a graduate in Office Administration, Business Administration, AB English, or equivalent course\n• Excellent verbal and written communication skills\n• At least 1 year of experience related to the field or alike\n• With basic knowledge of legal procedure and process\n• Goal-oriented, keen on details and organize\n• Must be proficient in Microsoft Office (Excel, Word, and PPT)\n\nInterested applicants can send their application letter to 𝗿𝗳𝘁𝗴𝗹𝗮𝘄𝗼𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗲@𝗴𝗺𝗮𝗶𝗹.𝗰𝗼𝗺 with the subject: LEGAL SECRETARY_SURNAME, FIRST NAME. \n\nApplications can also be dropped off in person at their office located at Purok 1, South Poblacion, Maramag, Bukidnon.\n\n𝗔𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗹𝘂𝗺𝗻𝗶 ‼️📣\n\nRFTG Law Office is seeking a qualified Legal Secretary to join their team in Maramag, Bukidnon! \n\n𝗤𝘂𝗮𝗹𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀:\n• Preferably a graduate in Office Administration, Business Administration, AB English, or equivalent course\n• Excellent verbal and written communication skills\n• At least 1 year of experience related to the field or alike\n• With basic knowledge of legal procedure and process\n• Goal-oriented, keen on details and organize\n• Must be proficient in Microsoft Office (Excel, Word, and PPT)\n\nInterested applicants can send their application letter to 𝗿𝗳𝘁𝗴𝗹𝗮𝘄𝗼𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗲@𝗴𝗺𝗮𝗶𝗹.𝗰𝗼𝗺 with the subject: LEGAL SECRETARY_SURNAME, FIRST NAME. \n\nApplications can also be dropped off in person at their office located at Purok 1, South Poblacion, Maramag, Bukidnon.	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/476512397_122204451512194106_4019942054482225484_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=dd6889&_nc_ohc=S4hzsLG7I6UQ7kNvwG3-BkY&_nc_oc=Adr0bRVVh67YK96JPJCYXi2J_6iOgnqBWS4HNfgzRLv52ktyaj2AjTFwZNqGG6SwcYo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scon