868a3102-1d15-444b-926e-fa46e16ab58f	[𝗥𝗘𝗔𝗗] 𝟰𝟬 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗴𝗿𝗶𝗰𝘂𝗹𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗱𝘂𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘀 𝗵𝗶𝗿𝗲𝗱 𝗯𝘆 𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗹𝗱-𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘀𝘀 𝗔𝗴𝗿𝗶𝗯𝗶𝘇 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝘆	[𝗥𝗘𝗔𝗗] 𝟰𝟬 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗴𝗿𝗶𝗰𝘂𝗹𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗱𝘂𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘀 𝗵𝗶𝗿𝗲𝗱 𝗯𝘆 𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗹𝗱-𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘀𝘀 𝗔𝗴𝗿𝗶𝗯𝗶𝘇 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝘆\n\nForty fresh graduates and alumni from Central Mindanao University's (CMU) College of Agriculture have secured employment with Biotech Farms Incorporated, a world-class agribusiness company known for its high-quality pork and egg products in Mindanao. The hiring process, facilitated by the Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages (OARL), saw candidates from various programs, including Animal Science, Crop Science, and Entomology, among others, successfully landing positions.\n\nRead the full story here: https://www.cmu.edu.ph/40-cmu-agriculture-graduates-hired-by-world-class-agribiz-company/\n\n[𝗥𝗘𝗔𝗗] 𝟰𝟬 𝗖𝗠𝗨 𝗔𝗴𝗿𝗶𝗰𝘂𝗹𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗱𝘂𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘀 𝗵𝗶𝗿𝗲𝗱 𝗯𝘆 𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗹𝗱-𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘀𝘀 𝗔𝗴𝗿𝗶𝗯𝗶𝘇 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝘆\n\nForty fresh graduates and alumni from Central Mindanao University's (CMU) College of Agriculture have secured employment with Biotech Farms Incorporated, a world-class agribusiness company known for its high-quality pork and egg products in Mindanao. The hiring process, facilitated by the Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages (OARL), saw candidates from various programs, including Animal Science, Crop Science, and Entomology, among others, successfully landing positions.\n\nRead the full story here: https://www.cmu.edu.ph/40-cmu-agriculture-graduates-hired-by-world-class-agribiz-company/	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/487380477_1079433587562301_4514321838379057919_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=_sGrJqqUz14Q7kNvwEwkLzy&_nc_oc=AdrBVxCDGIp2cyiJh6Zd-2_0sQxGCuU7pCZowTVLfbAZFftIJymNCbIlLtAlll2dP1c&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEpE_x5GMT5UR7EEx2yfDoRZN1Ny0C9IUttifUpPRno22sXJn745z9HHmdhEO1JB-Vq7LF1aAsIsA&oh=00_Af5L9AdEIs8maSmIy7Me2DaGKP7Ok9ebMMtViUc9kiWWOw&oe=6A019384	https://