2f5cde10-53eb-416d-934a-227a0a8a7cf0	Facebook Page Update	[HIRING] The Department of Social Sciences, College of Arts & Sciences needs two (2) Political Science and two (2) Philosophy Instructors for the First Semester, AY 2024–2025.\n⁣\nQualification:\nPreferably with Graduate Degree/Units (MS/PhD) related to Political Science or Philosophy\n⁣\nRequirements:\n[1] Application Letter addressed to:\n        ROLITO G. EBALLE, PhD \n        University President\n Central Mindanao University⁣\n        \n Through \n LEA LEI M. BONGGAS\n Chairperson, Department of Social Sciences\n[2] Transcript of Records\n[3] Personal Data Sheet/Curriculum Vitae\n⁣\n⁣\nInterested applicants may submit their complete application documents to cas.socsci@cmu.edu.ph on or before July 22, 2024.\n⁣\nTeaching Demo will be on July 24, 2024, 1:00-4:00 pm at CAS AACCUP Room	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/486978771_1079192157586444_3741333727561836641_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=WDqhZ6TxQAUQ7kNvwFHOULJ&_nc_oc=AdpDZx_-vGhTxTyj3OIzDLXyAmyN6mLZyRKL6PFi8LSz6EO6Ksu1dhWNbvNuIBRPwVs&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQHo6kTwet38ZkYKTXRuNRqy-031vcJKtY_t21V5IpEwtcgpi1wmvgyz7LNjsRQDp-ogYYguSTLGAA&oh=00_Af6yddxMC7DgIPboSnvACacQMkY7RU_Wo8NiviwXXhf2DQ&oe=6A01B651	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122161982492194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-07-17 06:01:14+08	\N	0	\N	2024-07-17 06:01:14+08	2024-07-17 06:01:14+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122161982492194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122161982492194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:05+08
