c0496c44-1784-4441-bb24-c0b5d773f85d	[𝗝𝗨𝗦𝗧 𝗜𝗡] Central Mindanao University is the 𝟰𝘁𝗵 𝘁𝗼𝗽-𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗺𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝘀𝗰𝗵𝗼𝗼𝗹 in the March 2024 Licensure Examination for Professional Teachers (Secondary). Congratulations to our newly Licensed Professional Teachers, especially to 𝗜𝘃𝗮𝗻 𝗣𝗟𝗮𝘇𝗮 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝘃𝗲𝘇, 𝗧𝗼𝗽 𝟴.	[𝗝𝗨𝗦𝗧 𝗜𝗡] Central Mindanao University is the 𝟰𝘁𝗵 𝘁𝗼𝗽-𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗺𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝘀𝗰𝗵𝗼𝗼𝗹 in the March 2024 Licensure Examination for Professional Teachers (Secondary). Congratulations to our newly Licensed Professional Teachers, especially to 𝗜𝘃𝗮𝗻 𝗣𝗟𝗮𝘇𝗮 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝘃𝗲𝘇, 𝗧𝗼𝗽 𝟴. \n\nWe are proud of you!\nKudos to the College of Education. 👏👏🎉🎊\n\n#CMUpride #LEPT2024 #TEACHERS #professionalteachers\n\nPhotos from Central Mindanao University's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/487364825_1077653204407006_4952940050766550770_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=WX-qajXTokwQ7kNvwFzV-BV&_nc_oc=Adr4axQwyiCwLtwU9xHYSKKkY-83B-nkvJwJwTFanmngJ-LDe_KFj6MyCTtdbaj_2Pw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-2.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQHD8JjT44Q9dr3arLmXQEq461jpj0CXEsKgBXnDg61pSTBVhQY8UpCh4nGSFoomwRpwn8OgxULm2A&oh=00_Af4PNLVnHtNDF_zwblnuVRi8gcws0I0oIndW7k8DGWcoeA&oe=6A01A1CC	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122149328420194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-05-24 05:02:32+08	\N	0	\N	2024-05-24 05:02:32+08	2024-05-24 05:02:32+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122149328420194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122149328420194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:05+08
