795ac7b9-33c3-41ab-b7db-52d03b8f6574	𝑨 𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒆𝒘𝒆?	𝑨 𝒓𝒆𝒏𝒆𝒘𝒆𝒅 𝒆𝒓𝒂 𝒐𝒇 𝒖𝒏𝒊𝒕𝒚 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝒅𝒊𝒓𝒆𝒄𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝒏𝒐𝒘 𝒅𝒆𝒇𝒊𝒏𝒆𝒔 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝑪𝒆𝒏𝒕𝒓𝒂𝒍 𝑴𝒊𝒏𝒅𝒂𝒏𝒂𝒐 𝑼𝒏𝒊𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒚 𝒂𝒍𝒖𝒎𝒏𝒊 𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒎𝒖𝒏𝒊𝒕𝒚\n\nFebruary 5–6, 2026 | Lorega, Kitaotao, Bukidnon  \n\nA decisive step toward a stronger and more unified alumni community has been taken.\n\nThrough firm collaboration between the Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages and the CMU Alumni Association, a clear institutional framework is now in place to transform alumni engagement into a sustained force for university development, mentorship, and legacy building. The recently concluded strategic planning gathering in Lorega set the direction for global alumni mapping, activation of regional and international chapters, scholarship and endowment initiatives, professional linkages, and structured alumni participation in the academic and development programs of Central Mindanao University.\n\nAt the forefront of this transformation is OARL Director Atty. James M. Violon, who actively advanced the approval, recognition, and full institutional support for the CMU Alumni Association under the leadership of its newly elected President, Dr. Maria Luz Soriano. Through strong coordination with the University Administration and key stakeholders, the strategic plan of the Association is now fully aligned with the broader development thrusts of the University and ready for implementation.\n\nThe adopted direction prioritizes a consolidated alumni database, activated college based councils, expanded national and international chapters, and the establishment of scholarship, mentorship, and assistance programs for students. It also sets in motion collaborative fundraising, alumni participation in research and extension initiatives, and flagship institutional events that strengthen pride, unity, and long term engagement.\n\nWith this foundation firmly established, the CMU Alumni Homecoming and Unified Foundation celebration this September 2026 is set to become a historic convergence of generations and the first major gathering under the revitalized alumni structure.\n\nThe Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages, in full partnership with the CMU Alumni Association led by Dr. Maria Luz Soriano and with the support of the University Administration, proudly announces the Central Mindanao University Alumni Homecoming 2026 this coming September. Alumni across generations may expect a dynamic and highly competitive celebration among the eleven colleges, now further enriched by the emergence of two new colleges from the former College of Arts and Sciences.\n\nMajor highlights include:\n\nKALAYO: The 1st CMU FlameFest 2026  \nStudent–Alumni Mass Dance Competition.\n\nBIDLISIW: Alumni Homecoming Live Concert Spectacular  \nA night of music, lights, and CMU pride.\n\nMx. CMU Pride Royale 2026  \nAn inclusive alumni coronation night.\n\nMiss CMU All-Stars: Alumni Legends Edition 2026  \nThe grand return of past CMU queens.\n\nPUKSAAN: The Grand Float Carnival  \nA vibrant college and alumni showdown.\n\n1st CMU Student–Alumni Film Festival 2026  \nA showcase of storytelling and shared legacy.\n\nThese initiatives, led by the Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages and supported by the CMU Alumni Association and the University Administration, form part of the unified alumni strategic roadmap now being rolled out across the institution.\n\nThe CMU Alumni Homecoming 2026 is more than a reunion. It is the consolidation of leadership, direction, and unity across generations of CMU graduates.\n\nThis September 2026, the CMU community returns home stronger and more united than ever.\n\n#CentralMindanaoUniversity  \n#CMUAlumniHomecoming2026  \n#OARLAndAlumniUnited  \n#AcademicParadiseOfTheSouth  \n#CMUAlumniRising\n\nPhotos from CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/628390804_122268328412194106_3900687255721327488_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7b2446&_nc_ohc=aEroiOd-ZIAQ7kNvwHLqTBh&_nc_oc=AdqCw7XRgmjCc-JANd4dUnKIeY6hIc-YddMbM2W2WjzbK1w8LEsMQiNYoejy0-FJS38&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEdYKcmbz7mZDnjQ4qDqIRrSF_0eYSxwiBu2bEzPDAMnvvPpkfwd3qIH-Am11fF5EeQuN7qw0Z1Gw&oh=00_Af5Ta9n-LU2-snmBESRxf3bEaBZaI3W6iI-np4xLeEsTvA&oe=6A01B0BA	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122268328280194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2026-02-07 09:03:25+08	\N	0	\N	2026-02-07 09:03:25+08	2026-02-07 09:03:25+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122268328280194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122268328280194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:04+08
