9d46af79-3d11-4394-8549-cdff6941dc03	On May 3, 2024, 𝗩𝗠 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘀𝘂𝗹𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗰𝘆 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗩𝗶𝘀𝗮 𝗦𝗲𝗿𝘃𝗶𝗰𝗲𝘀 𝗜𝗻𝗰. conducted an orientation for CMU alumni, staff, and students at Fulbright Garden, in collaboration with the CMU Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages and the CMU Alumni Association, Inc.	On May 3, 2024, 𝗩𝗠 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘀𝘂𝗹𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗰𝘆 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗩𝗶𝘀𝗮 𝗦𝗲𝗿𝘃𝗶𝗰𝗲𝘀 𝗜𝗻𝗰. conducted an orientation for CMU alumni, staff, and students at Fulbright Garden, in collaboration with the CMU Office of Alumni Relations and Linkages and the CMU Alumni Association, Inc. \n\nThis activity provide valuable insights and information about essential aspects of studying abroad, visa application procedures, academic partner institutions, living arrangements, and other pertinent details.\n\nPhotos from CMU Office of the Alumni Relations and Linkages's post	Update	Medium	All	https://scontent.fcgy3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/474549813_122200308482194106_8407466015343200757_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=13d280&_nc_ohc=xM0Bi0r2J_gQ7kNvwGhoz2D&_nc_oc=Adp4T3Az_Syh-C9VWbJMEbxse3YhG7BPl1syO__99ye68FmR9hrtytAsIVA-Wodpec8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcgy3-1.fna&edm=AKIiGfEEAAAA&_nc_gid=vkb6lpMGbFtyr5HUL1YbKg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQEjEG_9lp_GnklMtB-k5zwCubXTOU7GFqB_MVwt5DflQ2fgK28P6Ie_0grQ_55zUu_Q8_Yu5KuuqQ&oh=00_Af4A_eGbfibaRhyNo6TGvfHocz_js6K9sub13ayQ42bv9Q&oe=6A0192B5	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122144951588194106&id=233393753185586	\N	\N	t	2024-05-07 06:04:20+08	\N	0	\N	2024-05-07 06:04:20+08	2024-05-07 06:04:20+08	\N	\N	\N	\N	233393753185586_122144951588194106	https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=122144951588194106&id=233393753185586	2026-05-07 07:09:06+08
